  ('field.start.logExceptionSent', 'Exception recorded at ±{acc}m — this record cannot be changed', 'تم تسجيل الاستثناء عند دقة ±{acc} متر — لا يمكن تعديل هذا السجل', 'draft', 'page.tsx toast/log message after an exception is recorded during check-in; removed dev-jargon ''immutable geo event''. Arabic authored here (t() has no inline AR param in this file; real value lives in ui_strings via /admin/localization — flag for import there).')
